C6FBCA9C18E52B/D1B69DB8/7E816\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=foRLkDo7Cbo7l8MRmT7nmGiMmARnzT7VUlUbnRCZnz7boRC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy4nSy4USybM4VVMmnknz7PUNLYoRlYUNLiL49an7VfLRWFMz7aU4rkn7MFL4UPMm9agtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM478oSbw62V8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17149&e=.jpg\"></p><p></p><p>&nbsp;此次访企拓岗活动，进一步搭建了校企精准对接桥梁，为后续开展专场招聘、实习实训合作奠定了坚实基础，切实将访企拓岗成效转化为推动毕业生就业的实际动力。</p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=fUNLkDMR7snmV2MR4CiM77YUlQknRL7solQ7LNrVnzMVL470gihFp2hmCIa0okyankyZMYh2L77bnRvDMR9sLmTRL8UiLmGsLmf7L4-DnmrFLzf2LN-ZnzTFMml4nm9Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sLzUbgtA8pUVcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17149&e=.jpg"}